# 텍스트 파일 분리 창 메모리 진단 — PDF를 뒤에 열어 PDF가 선택된 채(본 창은 편집기를 그리지 않음) 텍스트 탭만 분리하는 판(덩어리 39). 임시 홈 이름 memory-text-diag.
waittabs 1 @30000
waitstate cwd=C: @30000
send $p = "$env:USERPROFILE\\proj-fdp"; Set-Content "$p\\notes.txt" ((1..400 | ForEach-Object { "line $_ of the notes file" }) -join "`n"); cd $p\r
send echo MEM-TD\r
waitline MEM-TD @20000
act openpath C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-text-diag/proj-fdp/notes.txt
waitstate kind=text state=text @15000
act openpath C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-text-diag/proj-fdp/sample-3p.pdf
waitstate kind=pdf state=pdf pages=3 @15000
wait 15000
mem d-before
gpumem d-before
act detachsize 900 600
act movetowindow file C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-text-diag/proj-fdp/notes.txt
waitstate notes.txt place=detached @10000
wait 10000
mem d-open-1
gpumem d-open-1
act moveback file C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-text-diag/proj-fdp/notes.txt
waitstate notes.txt selected shown place=main @10000
wait 10000
mem d-back-1
gpumem d-back-1
act movetowindow file C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-text-diag/proj-fdp/notes.txt
waitstate notes.txt place=detached @10000
wait 10000
mem d-open-2
gpumem d-open-2
act moveback file C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-text-diag/proj-fdp/notes.txt
waitstate notes.txt selected shown place=main @10000
wait 10000
mem d-back-2
gpumem d-back-2
act movetowindow file C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-text-diag/proj-fdp/notes.txt
waitstate notes.txt place=detached @10000
wait 10000
mem d-open-3
gpumem d-open-3
act moveback file C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-text-diag/proj-fdp/notes.txt
waitstate notes.txt selected shown place=main @10000
wait 10000
mem d-back-3
gpumem d-back-3
act movetowindow file C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-text-diag/proj-fdp/notes.txt
waitstate notes.txt place=detached @10000
wait 10000
mem d-open-4
gpumem d-open-4
act moveback file C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-text-diag/proj-fdp/notes.txt
waitstate notes.txt selected shown place=main @10000
wait 10000
mem d-back-4
gpumem d-back-4
wait 40000
mem d-final
gpumem d-final
quit
